ים</a> ·\n    <a href=\"https://www.parasha-week.co.il/search/label/5-06%20%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%A9%D7%AA%20%D7%9B%D7%99%20%D7%AA%D7%A6%D7%90\">כי תצא</a> ·\n    <a href=\"https://www.parasha-week.co.il/search/label/5-07%20%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%A9%D7%AA%20%D7%9B%D7%99%20%D7%AA%D7%91%D7%95%D7%90\">כי תבוא</a> ·\n    <a href=\"https://www.parasha-week.co.il/search/label/5-08%20%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%A9%D7%AA%20%D7%A0%D7%A6%D7%91%D7%99%D7%9D\">נצבים</a> ·\n    <a href=\"https://www.parasha-week.co.il/search/label/5-09%20%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%A9%D7%AA%20%D7%95%D7%99%D7%9C%D7%9A\">וילך</a> ·\n    <a href=\"https://www.parasha-week.co.il/search/label/5-10%20%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%A9%D7%AA%20%D7%94%D7%90%D7%96%D7%99%D7%A0%D7%95\">האזינו</a> ·\n    <a href=\"https://www.parasha-week.co.il/search/label/5-11%20%D7%A4%D7%A8%D7%A9%D7%AA%20%D7%95%D7%96%D7%90%D7%AA%20%D7%94%D7%91%D7%A8%D7%9B%D7%94\">וזאת הברכה</a></span>\n  </p>\n</div>"
